+    "summary": "MAR-2918: multiple active heads for one kind/subject are reported by validate but do not block reads, cache preparation, init or adds to other groups.",
+    "rationale": [
+      "Canonical records live in Git, so parallel branches superseding the same head produce a routine merge conflict.",
+      "Blocking every operation on one conflicted subject disabled Encephalon for all agents until a manual resolver landed."
